            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yamutegetse abicishije muri Mose. Uko kwari ukwibutsa Abisirayeli ko ata muntu n’umwe atari uwo mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni yokwubahuka guturirira ibimota neza imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", atagomba kuba nka Kora n’abamukurikiye.",
          "type": "text",
