        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko igihe abagize ikoraniro bariko baratonganya Mose na Aroni bahindukiye ngo barabe ihema ry’ibonaniro, ubwo nyene igicu caciye kiripfuka ubwiza bw’",
          "type": "text",
