        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Mose abarira Aroni ati: “Fata icotezo ushiremwo ibimota neza n’umuriro uvuye ku gicaniro, uce wihuta uje mu bantu ubatangire ikimazi gikura icaha. Uburake buvuye k’",
