          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Aroni akora nk’uko Mose yamubwiye, aca yiruka mu bantu. Ikiza cari camaze gutangura kwica abantu. Ariko Aroni aturira ibimota neza ngo abatangire ikimazi gikura ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
